Some generic pestle and mortar made of fancy rock. Looks best with rock-featuring furniture. High-detailed model for close shots to look good.
Features:

  - 2048x2048 textures and high polycount so model looks good in close;

  - made in scale — pestle is about 70mm height and 90mm in diameter;

  - all-quads topology;

  - fully unwraped and textured;

  - textures saved as separate files so you can use them in any other 3D application.

Files included:

  - .blend file with packed-in textures;

  - .obj file;

  - .fbx file;

  - 2048x2048 textures (color and roughness maps).

-High-quality polygonal model with realistic textures and materials detailed enough for close-up renders;
-All materials are set up and ready for rendering in 3ds max Corona and Vray;
-Objects and materials have logical names;
Please note that the FBX file can not import materials and light, only the geometry itself.
